<title>USA: CBOT July 1997 volume up 5.5 pct from July 1996.</title>
<headline>CBOT July 1997 volume up 5.5 pct from July 1996.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board of Trade's (CBOT) futures and options volume totaled 19,312,441 contracts in July 1997, up 5.5 percent from 18,302,731 in July 1996, the CBOT said on Monday.</p>
<p>Trading volume from January to July 1997 rose 0.3 percent to 136,032,986, from 135,639,197 in the same period in 1996, the exchange said.</p>
